        {
          "id": "p2-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "瀬戸大橋を渡って、愛媛県新居浜市。",
          "en": "Across the Seto Ohashi Bridge: Niihama, Ehime."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……その浮き輪、何",
          "en": "...Swim ring?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "視察だろ？　見るだけなら海も見る",
          "en": "Inspection, right? I'll inspect the sea."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "新居浜は、別子銅山とともに育った工業の町",
          "en": "Niihama is a factory town that grew up with the Besshi Copper Mine."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "1691年に掘りはじめて、閉山は1973年。283年よ",
          "en": "Mining began in 1691 and ended in 1973. 283 years."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "つまり、うまいもんの町だな!!",
          "en": "So basically, it's a town with good food!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "聞きなさいよ!!",
          "en": "LISTEN TO ME!!"
        }
      ]
    },
